    ("retrieval", "medium", "When is Section 67 IT Act used? What about 67A and 67B?", ["Information Technology Act, 2000", "67"], "Sec 67 = Obscene electronic publication/transmission (3y/₹5L first; 5y/₹10L repeat). 67A = Sexually explicit content (7y). 67B = Child pornography (min 5y; 7y repeat). Sec 69/69A = blocking/surveillance with Government approval. SC in Shreya Singhal (2015) STRUCK DOWN 66A (free speech), NOT 66/67/67A/67B.", ["it act 67", "67a", "67b", "obscenity", "child pornography", "shreya singhal"]),
